== Walkthrough ==

Daleen Leafsway may be found in the garden at {{Loc|Rivervale|-85, -345}} outside the Druid guild.

You must be amiable or better (with which faction?) to get this quest.

She will randomly blurt out the following dialogue:

: Daleen Leafsway says 'Oh Dear.. I can't believe I forgot.. He must be [starving]!'

You say, 'Who is starving?'

: Daleen Leafsway says 'Deputy Eigon! I forgot! I was supposed to bring him some turnips to eat while he is on patrol! Oh... He asked so nicely, too. I feel bad that I forgot. If only someone would take these [turnips] to the Deputy..'

You say, 'I will take the turnips.'

: Daleen Leafsway says 'Oh, thank you so much! You can keep any payment he gives you. Be sure to tell him I'm sorry.'

'''You receive a Sack of Turnips. Deputy Eigon may be found in the {{Loc|Misty Thicket|-125,-25}}.  Give him the sack.'''

: Deputy Eigon says 'Daleen sent you? She is so sweet. If she wasn't married.. ehem.. Thanks.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Guardians of the Vale]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Mayor Gubbin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Storm Reapers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Rivervale]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dreadguard Outer]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}} (minimal) 1% per turn in at level 6

You gain a random amount of coin ranging from a few 2 copper to a couple pieces of gold.

